@HorizonBoulevard great video, however quite a few inaccuracies about Cluj-Napoca:
- Mathias Rex statue and the church are in Union square, not Avram Iancu square.
- The lake pictured is not Chios lake, Chios is in the city center and is way more picturesque, being surrounded by the park and old vilas

